SUMMARY:Toy Drive for Día de Reyes
DESCRIPTION:Give Back and Celebrate with Casa Familiar\nJoin us for a special evening of giving back in support of Casa Familiar’s Día de Reyes Celebration. \nBring a new\, unwrapped toy for a child ages 0–13 to help make the holiday season brighter for local families.  Stay for a fun-filled karaoke night and the chance to win raffle prizes! \nPlease note: This is a 21+ event.  \nMonetary donations are also welcome. Scan the QR code to make a contribution and help us bring holiday joy to children in our community.
URL:https://www.casafamiliar.org/event/toy-drive/
LOCATION:Brewjería Taproom & Kitchen\, 241 3rd Ave C\, Chula Vista\, 91910\, United States
CATEGORIES:Signature Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.casafamiliar.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Dia-de-Reyes-Toy-Drive.png
END:VEVENT
